about: inserting into {} opens it up, the inverse of json-delete-entry-last
op: insertJsonEntry
path: ["features"]
=== input
{
  "features": {},
  "shared": {}
}
=== entry
    "widget": {
      "paths": ["apps/widget"]
    }
=== output
{
  "features": {
    "widget": {
      "paths": ["apps/widget"]
    }
  },
  "shared": {}
}
